    "color_palette": "Specify 'Vibrant colors' and 'High saturation' to make the miniature model look more vivid and textured than the real world."
  },
  "prompt_template": "A stunning 3D miniature diorama of {argument name="city name" default="Paris"}, the entire cityscape is folded 180 degrees vertically in 'Inception' movie style, with buildings hanging from the top and rising from the bottom meeting in the center. Miniature tiny figurines of people walking on gravity-defying streets. High-detail macro photography, tilt-shift effect, realistic plastic and glass textures. Cinematic lighting,  vibrant and saturated colors, glowing city neon lights. Hyper-realistic, 8k resolution, octane render, unreal engine 5 style, intricate details.",
  "usage_instruction": "Simply replace [City Name] with the city you want (e.g., Guangzhou, Tokyo, Paris, etc.) to generate a folding miniature landscape featuring that city's landmarks."
}

